# ===================== Terraform =====================
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfstate.backup
crash.log
crash.*.log

# Arquivos de variaveis (contem OCIDs, caminhos de chave, IPs) - NAO versionar
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!*.tfvars.example

# Overrides locais
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc
# Obs: .terraform.lock.hcl DEVE ser versionado (trava versao dos providers)

